                    "settings": {
                        "html": "<div class='sacred-hero'><div class='sacred-hero-bg'><img src='https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1499209974431-9dddcece7f88?q=80&w=2000&auto=format&fit=crop' alt='Hero' /></div><div class='sacred-blur-1'></div><div class='sacred-blur-2'></div><div class='sacred-hero-content'><div class='reveal'><span class='sacred-hero-label'>Offerings of Presence</span></div><h1 class='sacred-hero-title reveal reveal-delay-1'>The Sacred<br><span class='italic'>Stillness</span></h1><p class='sacred-hero-subtitle reveal reveal-delay-2'>A deliberate return to the center. Not an escape from the world, but a deeper integration into it.</p><div class='reveal reveal-delay-3'><div class='sacred-hero-cta-wrap'><a href='#memberships' class='sacred-hero-cta'><span>Begin the Journey</span> <i class='fas fa-arrow-right'></i></a></div></div></div><div class='sacred-hero-footer reveal reveal-delay-3'> <div class='sacred-coords'><div>43° N / 79° W</div><div>Canada's First Sanctuary</div></div><div class='sacred-scroll'><span>Scroll</span><div class='sacred-scroll-line'><div class='sacred-scroll-progress'></div></div></div></div></div><style>.sacred-hero { position: relative; height: 100vh; width: 100%; overflow: hidden; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: #0E1B30; color: #FFFFFF; font-family: 'Lato', sans-serif; }.sacred-hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0; opacity: 0.4; }.sacred-hero-bg img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; filter: grayscale(100%) brightness(50%); }.sacred-blur-1 { position: absolute; top: 25%; left: 10%; width: 256px; height: 256px; background: rgba(104, 143, 157, 0.2); border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(64px); animation: sacredBreathe 8s ease-in-out infinite; }.sacred-blur-2 { position: absolute; bottom: 25%; right: 10%; width: 384px; height: 384px; background: rgba(217, 232, 235, 0.1); border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(64px); animation: sacredBreathe 8s ease-in-out infinite; animation-delay: 2s; }.sacred-hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 10; text-align: center; padding: 0 24px; width: 100%; max-width: 100%; }.sacred-hero-label { display: inline-block; color: #688F9D; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 32px; font-weight: 700; }.sacred-hero-title { font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif; font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 8rem); line-height: 0.9; margin-bottom: 32px; font-weight: 400; color: #F7F0EC; }.sacred-hero-title .italic { font-style: italic; font-weight: 300; }.sacred-hero-subtitle { color: rgba(247, 240, 236, 0.6); max-width: 512px; margin: 0 auto 48px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.6; font-size: 16px; }.sacred-hero-cta { position: relative; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 20px 40px; border: 1px solid rgba(247, 240, 236, 0.2); border-radius: 99px; color: #F7F0EC; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-size: 14px; transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1); }.sacred-hero-cta:hover { transform: scale(1.05); border-color: rgba(247, 240, 236, 0.4); }.sacred-hero-cta i { color: #688F9D; transition: transform 0.5s ease; }.sacred-hero-cta:hover i { transform: translateX(8px); }.sacred-hero-footer { position: absolute; bottom: 48px; left: 0; width: 100%; padding: 0 48px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-end; opacity: 0.4; color: #F7F0EC; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; }.sacred-coords { display: flex; gap: 48px; }.sacred-scroll { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }.sacred-scroll-line { width: 48px; height: 2px; background: rgba(247, 240, 236, 0.2); position: relative; }.sacred-scroll-progress { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; height: 100%; width: 33%; background: #688F9D; }.reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); animation: revealFadeUp 1.2s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) forwards; }.reveal-delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }.reveal-delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }.reveal-delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.6s; }@keyframes revealFadeUp { to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }@keyframes sacredBreathe { 0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.3; } 50% { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: 0.5; } }</style>"
                    },
